{{Otheruses|the free-to-play guide|the members' guide|Pay-to-play Ranged training}}
[[Ranged]] in the [[free-to-play]] [[Server|worlds]], while having less [[equipment]] and features than in [[member]]'s worlds, provides some fun with the ability to battle [[monsters]] and [[players]] who would otherwise be out of reach.

This guide will provide advice for the [[Ranged equipment|equipment]], [[attack style]], and training locations to use to maximise [[Ranged]] experience gained in [[free-to-play]].

